  "<span class=\"mkey__swatch mkey__swatch--dash\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Dashed — derived or assumed by us": "<span class=\"mkey__swatch mkey__swatch--dash\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Gestrichelt – von uns abgeleitet oder angenommen",
