  "Source: <span class=\"fn\">BZL 2025 <sup><a href=\"#src-bzl\" aria-label=\"Source 9: BZL supply balance 2025 (provisional) — calculated meat consumption\">[9]</a></sup></span><span class=\"nmarks\"> <sup class=\"nmark\"><a href=\"#note-xvi\" aria-label=\"Number note xvi: Germany’s meat: 4.6 Mt, ≈ 1.06 Mt or ≈ 3.54 Mt\">≠xvi</a></sup></span>": "Source: <span class=\"fn\">BZL 2025 <sup><a href=\"#src-bzl\" aria-label=\"Source 9: BZL supply balance 2025 (provisional) — calculated meat consumption\">[9]</a></sup></span><span class=\"nmarks\"> <sup class=\"nmark\"><a href=\"#note-xvi\" aria-label=\"Number note xvi: Germany’s meat: 4.6 Mt, ≈ 1.06 Mt or ≈ 3.54 Mt\">≠xvi</a></sup></span>",
  "<span class=\"tcheck__badge\">Estimate</span> Only the households’ waste is measured (74.6 kt). For the whole chain this applies the EU-28 share (JRC, 2011: 14.2 of 61.7 Mt, 23%) to the 4.6 Mt calculated from the supply balance.": "<span class=\"tcheck__badge\">Schätzung</span> Es wird nur der Abfall der Haushalte gemessen (74,6 kt). Für die gesamte Kette gilt der EU-28-Anteil (JRC, 2011: 14,2 von 61,7 Mio. t, 23 %) auf die aus der Angebotsbilanz berechneten 4,6 Mio. t.",
